1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,200
I'm half Filipino, Hannah.

2
00:00:04,333 --> 00:00:06,567
And I hated it all of my life.

3
00:00:08,033 --> 00:00:09,767
But because of you,

4
00:00:09,767 --> 00:00:12,133
I fell in love
with my other side.

5
00:00:12,133 --> 00:00:15,400
[ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYING]

6
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:19,367
<i>Uh-oh, if there's alcohol,
there's mischief.</i>

7
00:00:19,367 --> 00:00:21,600
<i> So, this is just a joke?</i>

8
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:23,300
<i>You don't love me, pabo (dummy)?</i>

9
00:00:23,667 --> 00:00:25,200
<i> Just kidding.</i>

10
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:26,400
[MOUTHING]
<i> (In Filipino) I love you.</i>

11
00:00:27,233 --> 00:00:28,567
- I realized--
- [GASPS]

12
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:31,500
So it's true!

13
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,067
You can understand Tagalog!

14
00:00:35,567 --> 00:00:39,033
Hey, Kpaps, no going back
on your word, alright?

15
00:00:39,033 --> 00:00:41,367
You already hired me
as your translator.

16
00:00:41,367 --> 00:00:43,500
You'll still pay me
65,000 pesos, alright?

17
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,067
Okay.

18
00:00:45,067 --> 00:00:49,033
Only if you can translate this
last phrase for me.

19
00:00:49,033 --> 00:00:51,333
You still need translation
despite knowing Tagalog?

20
00:00:52,233 --> 00:00:54,667
<i> "Expensive profit."</i>

21
00:00:57,567 --> 00:00:59,233
<i>Mahal na kita
(expensive profit).</i>

22
00:00:59,233 --> 00:01:00,267
<i>Mahal din kita.
(I love you too.)</i>

23
00:01:00,267 --> 00:01:07,067
["GUSTO KITANG PAKASALAN"
BY JEL REY PLAYING]

24
00:01:13,133 --> 00:01:17,700
[SQUEALING]

25
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:24,667
["GUSTO KITANG PAKASALAN"
CONTINUES]

26
00:01:29,700 --> 00:01:31,567
Oh, you!

27
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:35,200
Of course, pabo.

28
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:37,067
Because what you've given me...

29
00:01:37,733 --> 00:01:40,633
is worth more than 65,000 pesos.

30
00:01:45,433 --> 00:01:47,300
You're priceless.

31
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:57,300
["GUSTO KITANG PAKASALAN"
CONTINUES]

32
00:02:13,367 --> 00:02:14,867
[CHAIRMAN SONG]
No kissing!

33
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:16,800
[MUSIC STOPS]

34
00:02:18,167 --> 00:02:19,733
You have to court me first!

35
00:02:20,433 --> 00:02:21,433
[LAUGHS]

36
00:02:21,433 --> 00:02:23,833
[GIGGLING]

37
00:02:23,833 --> 00:02:30,200
["GUSTO KITANG PAKASALAN"
RESUMES]

38
00:02:32,667 --> 00:02:35,500
[SQUEALING]

39
00:02:56,433 --> 00:03:03,433
["GUSTO KITANG PAKASALAN"
CONTINUES]
